{"id": "EUVD-2026-96568", "enisaUuid": "8fc286ee-981d-3f58-aa89-cd65fbe1ce49", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the saveDatarule handler of SysDepartPermissionController that allows any authenticated user to modify department data rules. Low-privileged attackers can send departId, permissionId and dataRuleIds to POST /sys/sysDepartPermission/datarule to change, add or clear data rules on any department-menu permission binding.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T12:17:40", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_depart_permission_datarule.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysDepartPermissionController.java#L205-L227", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sysdepartpermission-datarule-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108629", "GHSA-42x3-jmxr-w79h"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "dbca080a-ac9e-3147-9bd7-e3eec27d3908", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "aacb291c-3b4c-3057-8916-39473db1ac05", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}